title: New Bounds on the Binary Deletion Channel Capacity
abstract: >-
  Supplementary material for the paper: the fixed certificate objects, the interval
  and Arb verification programs, and the Lean 4 statements of the finite lemmas used
  to assemble the two bounds 0.12415 <= kappa <= 0.250984.
